29
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:07,310
But this competition

30
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,270
is different from before.

31
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,070
200 years ago,

32
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:14,960
