33
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,790
caused heavy casualties on both sides.

34
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:20,150
Our side even lost a Demon Commander-in-Chief

35
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,880
and a Vice Commander-in-Chief.

36
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:25,760
One of the Vice Commander-in-Chief filled the position of Commander-in-Chief.

37
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:26,990
For this reason,

38
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:31,320
there are currently 2 vacant Vice Commander-in-Chief positions.

39
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:34,190
Besides the rewards, this competition

40
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,340
is also a Vice Commander-in-Chief selection.

41
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:41,560
All the Demon Generals are eyeing these positions.

42
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:44,350
I needed 18 people with strong bodies

43
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:46,670
to refine the Eighteen Demonic Bodies.

44
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,110
Since you took Thirteen back,

45
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,310
I no longer have enough.

46
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:55,750
But I believe

47
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,670
that with your help,

48
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,350
I can become a Vice Commander-in-Chief

49
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:03,630
even without the Eighteen Demonic Bodies.

50
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,640
Since I've agreed,

51
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:07,400
I will help you with all my strength.

52
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,360
But I have an urgent matter to deal with before.

53
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:10,270
I'll come back

54
00:03:10,440 --> 00:03:11,390
