57
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,320
Ancestor !

58
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,470
The Ancestor is back !

59
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,510
It's the Ancestor !

60
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:25,910
The Ancestor has returned !

61
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,150
Ancestor !

62
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:28,470
The Ancestor is back !

63
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:32,070
We welcome back the Ancestor.

64
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:34,590
We welcome back the Ancestor !

65
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:36,390
This sight

66
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:39,550
