72
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:54,590
Now, we have both mastered Soul Flags and the spells you taught us.

73
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:55,670
Not bad.

74
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:11,630
Thirteen, you're awake !

75
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,990
Ancestor ?! You're safe !

76
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,590
Thirteen thanks the Ancestor for saving my life !

77
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:27,040
I know what happened.

78
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:28,560
This past year,

79
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:29,560
you've worked hard.

80
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,590
When the Ancestor left and didn't return...

81
00:04:34,280 --> 00:04:35,560
I thought that as long as you're safe

82
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,950
I could die without regrets !

83
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:39,040
I don't have much time.

84
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:41,510
I must go to Sky Demon City in 2 months.

85
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:44,320
Since both of you are here today,

86
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:46,160
