97
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:10,200
This is the next part of the Giant Demon Clan's body cultivation method.

98
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:11,750
Continue to cultivate it.

99
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:12,910
Thank you, Ancestor !

100
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,470
Ouyang Hua, Thirteen...

101
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,590
