107
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,320
Disciples will obey !

108
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,870
We will not disappoint the Ancestor !

109
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:36,470
This trip to Sky Demon City will be dangerous.

110
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:39,270
Although the Billion-Soul Flag isn't fully refilled yet,

111
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:41,600
I can still use it.

112
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,630
The Soul Refining Tribe

113
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:56,880
