114
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:08,110
Take care of the tribe.

115
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:09,680
Dismissed.

116
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:10,600
Understood.

117
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:13,630
Ancestor...

118
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:16,270
Hu Pao, he...

119
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:18,470
He might already be...

120
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:20,040
