129
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:43,560
Demon Tower\NAncient Battleground\NSky Demon Country

130
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:43,430
Master,

131
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:45,390
I have learned that

132
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:48,510
