144
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:22,200
Hu Pao pays respects to Benefactor !

145
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:24,150
You've made good progress lately.

146
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:27,950
Once you refine all the souls of this ancient battleground,

147
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:30,870
