148
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:33,390
This is all thanks to Benefactor !

149
00:07:33,960 --> 00:07:34,920
You saved my life,

150
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:35,750
taught me spells,

151
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,840
and brought me here to cultivate.

152
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,680
Hu Pao will remember your kindness !

153
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:50,000
2 months later

154
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:04,880
Wang Lin...

155
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:07,080
Now tell me

156
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:08,950
