176
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:06,760
That means I need to rely on the Celestial Slaughter Art.

177
00:09:07,680 --> 00:09:10,270
The Life Seals refined by the Celestial Slaughter Art

178
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:12,350
can be used offensively.

179
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:14,440
They're hard to defend against.

180
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:17,110
I have killed many living beings

181
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:19,670
but I have only refined a couple Life Seals.

182
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:22,390
The few times I refined a Life Seal

183
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,350
appear to be random.

184
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,990
What's the logic behind them ?

185
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:28,670
Brother Wang,

186
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:30,870
the time has come.

187
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:32,270
Let's go.

188
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:35,920
Sky Demon City

189
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:39,400
Sky Demon City

190
