Welcome, Demon General Mo !

191
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,670
After 30 years...

192
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:54,430
I'm finally back.

193
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:10,350
We pay respects to the Demon General.

194
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:12,790
Stand up !

195
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:16,550
This is my good friend, Vice-General Wang.

196
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:17,790
When you meet him,

197
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:19,390
