198
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:20,630
We pay respects to Vice-General Wang !

199
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:22,430
Brother Wang,

200
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,190
please.

201
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:28,920
Imperial Capital\NSky Demon City

202
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:28,630
Blood Demon Wine, come take a look !

203
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:30,150
This thing looks beautiful.

204
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:30,990
Let's go take a look !

205
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:32,310
Blood Demon Wine !

206
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:34,030
So many river lanterns !

207
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:37,710
Take care.

208
00:10:58,680 --> 00:11:00,920
Isn't this the renowned Demon General Mo ?

209
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,880
