215
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,390
He is no ordinary soldier.

216
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:18,390
The capital, Sky Demon City, is divided into inner and outer city.

217
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:22,470
The Tian, De, Xuan, and Huang districts form the inner city.

218
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:26,950
The Yu, Zhou, Hong, and Huãng districts form the outer city.

219
00:11:27,560 --> 00:11:29,030
The inner city is for officials

220
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,550
and the outer city for the military.

221
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:34,670
I live in the Hong district.

222
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:37,280
If Brother Wang doesn't mind,

223
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:39,030
